{"id":"n25333-1-7","stage":3,"title":"공연장 · 剧场","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25333-1-7-1","ko":"내일 연극 보러 가기로 한 거 기억하지?","zh":"还记得我们说好明天一起去看话剧吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연극","meaning":"话剧，戏剧","explanation":"연극：话剧，戏剧","readings":[{"term":"연극","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13977","senseId":"1","lemma":"연극","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보러","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가기로","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기억하지?","meaning":"记着，记住","explanation":"기억하다：记着，记住；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"기억하다","audio":"/audio/de13679211bf48a797db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62319","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"ca8deda3ff79221b","term":"연극","zh":"话剧，戏剧","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3","entryId":"13977","definition":"演员在舞台上照着剧本向观众展示演技的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː극"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"把某事定下来。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"de13679211bf48a7","term":"기억하다","zh":"记着，记住","audio":"/audio/de13679211bf48a797db.mp3","entryId":"62319","definition":"不忘记或重新想起以前的模样、事实、知识、经验等。","pronunciation":["기어카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/09413f78a7891bd81658.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25333-1-7-2","ko":"응, 공연장 앞에서 7시에 만나자.","zh":"嗯，7点在剧院门口见吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공연장","meaning":"剧场，演出场地","explanation":"공연장：剧场，演出场地","readings":[{"term":"공연장","audio":"/audio/607077062c5e900a7010.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25333","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞에서","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"7시에","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；7：数字。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나자.","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"607077062c5e900a","term":"공연장","zh":"剧场，演出场地","audio":"/audio/607077062c5e900a7010.mp3","entryId":"25333","definition":"表演戏剧、歌曲、舞蹈等的地方。","pronunciation":["공연장"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e14637a703d6f2ac831e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.053,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25333","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6506,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，7点在剧院门口见吧。","现在几点了？怎么还没到啊？","还记得我们说好明天一起去看话剧吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，7点在剧院门口见吧。","还记得我们说好明天一起去看话剧吧？","现在几点了？怎么还没到啊？"],"answer":0}]}
